1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,150
Mia and Benny! The Rainbow Garden!

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,510
Good morning, friends! This is Mia.

3
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,239
MIA: Hi, everyone!

4
00:00:10,289 --> 00:00:12,948
And this is Mia's best friend, Benny the Bunny!

5
00:00:12,998 --> 00:00:14,400
BENNY: Hop, hop, hello!

6
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:16,698
MIA: Benny, let's grow a garden today!

7
00:00:16,748 --> 00:00:18,530
BENNY: Yay! A garden! What do we need?

8
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:22,113
MIA: We need a shovel, some seeds, water, and lots of sunshine!

9
00:00:22,163 --> 00:00:23,750
BENNY: I can help! Let's go!

10
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:28,357
First, Mia digs five little holes in the soil. Dig, dig, dig!

11
00:00:28,407 --> 00:00:31,294
Benny helps too. Bunnies are super diggers!

12
00:00:31,344 --> 00:00:32,987
BENNY: Dig, dig, dig, dig, dig!

13
00:00:33,037 --> 00:00:35,338
MIA: Now we need seeds. Let's count them!

14
00:00:35,388 --> 00:00:36,368
MIA: One!

15
00:00:36,418 --> 00:00:37,371
MIA: Two!

16
00:00:37,421 --> 00:00:38,449
MIA: Three!

17
00:00:38,499 --> 00:00:39,561
MIA: Four!

18
00:00:39,611 --> 00:00:40,874
MIA: Five!

19
00:00:40,924 --> 00:00:43,303
BENNY: Five little seeds, all tucked into bed!

20
00:00:43,503 --> 00:00:47,199
Seeds need water to grow. Benny brings the watering can.

21
00:00:47,249 --> 00:00:49,497
BENNY: Splish, splash! Drink up, little seeds!

22
00:00:49,547 --> 00:00:52,067
And seeds need warm sunshine, too!

23
00:00:52,117 --> 00:00:56,043
MIA: Sun up high, rain comes down, little seeds, grow up from the ground!

24
00:00:56,093 --> 00:00:59,980
BENNY: Sun up high, rain comes down, little seeds, grow up from the ground!

25
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,622
BENNY: Are they growing yet?

26
00:01:01,672 --> 00:01:05,707
Not yet, Benny. Growing takes time. Let's wait, and wait.

27
00:01:05,807 --> 00:01:08,325
MIA: Let's do a growing dance while we wait!

28
00:01:08,425 --> 00:01:10,711
MIA: Stretch up tall, like a flower!

29
00:01:10,811 --> 00:01:12,578
BENNY: Wiggle, wiggle, like a worm!

30
00:01:12,678 --> 00:01:15,259
MIA: And hop, hop, hop, like a bunny!

31
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:19,289
Look! Something is popping up!

32
00:01:19,339 --> 00:01:20,859
MIA: A red flower!

33
00:01:20,909 --> 00:01:22,207
BENNY: An orange flower!

34
00:01:22,257 --> 00:01:23,832
MIA: A yellow flower!

35
00:01:23,882 --> 00:01:25,096
BENNY: A blue flower!

36
00:01:25,146 --> 00:01:26,940
MIA: A purple flower!

37
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:34,526
And all the stems and leaves are green! Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, and purple. It's a rainbow garden!

38
00:01:34,826 --> 00:01:36,809
MIA: Let's sing the rainbow song!

39
00:01:36,859 --> 00:01:40,654
MIA: Red and orange, yellow too! Green and blue, and purple, woo!

40
00:01:40,754 --> 00:01:42,797
BENNY: Look, Mia! A butterfly came to visit!

41
00:01:42,847 --> 00:01:45,139
MIA: Our garden makes everyone happy!

42
00:01:45,189 --> 00:01:48,502
Which color flower is your favorite? Point to it!

43
00:01:49,602 --> 00:01:51,474
MIA: Thank you for helping, Benny!

44
00:01:51,524 --> 00:01:53,998
Mia and Benny share a big, happy hug.

45
00:01:54,048 --> 00:01:56,240
BENNY: Best friends grow the best gardens!

46
00:01:57,940 --> 00:02:00,226
Bye-bye, friends! See you next time!

47
00:02:00,276 --> 00:02:02,126
MIA: Bye-bye!
